    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcady Village is a life simulation where you manage your own arcade hall. Since the original owner disappeared, the residents of Arcady Village are no longer the same. The city is plagued by depression. Therefore, the mayor has decided to find a new operator for it: <strong>YOU</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/b3a18b8d9d1f78ab75205727fc14c2d2.poster.avif?t=1743450237\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/b3a18b8d9d1f78ab75205727fc14c2d2.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/b3a18b8d9d1f78ab75205727fc14c2d2.mp4?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform the run-down shack into a dreamlike arcade hall:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by operating the arcade hall. Open the shop and take care of customers as they spend money on your machines. From exchanging coins to clearing the trash, there's a lot to do, including physically removing customers who misbehave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/09a8fab9045ebb1e24f0a0a07defd6dd.poster.avif?t=1743450237\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/09a8fab9045ebb1e24f0a0a07defd6dd.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/09a8fab9045ebb1e24f0a0a07defd6dd.mp4?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become part of the Arcady Village community:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the residents of Arcady Village. Each resident has their own story to tell and needs your help to overcome it. Visit the residents daily to improve your relationships with them or engage in leisure activities together, such as a trip to the cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/ff9df90368e312702c83adceea59e8ae.poster.avif?t=1743450237\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/ff9df90368e312702c83adceea59e8ae.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/ff9df90368e312702c83adceea59e8ae.mp4?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set your own high scores:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all the arcade games you've acquired and achieve new high scores. The higher your score, the more you'll earn from your customers. Each resident has their favorite game, and they'll be impressed if you manage to surpass their high score in that particular game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/f1ee562892f4c8ec6ae80635182a0674.poster.avif?t=1743450237\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/f1ee562892f4c8ec6ae80635182a0674.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/f1ee562892f4c8ec6ae80635182a0674.mp4?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcady Village is a life simulation where you manage your own arcade hall. Since the original owner disappeared, the residents of Arcady Village are no longer the same. The city is plagued by depression. Therefore, the mayor has decided to find a new operator for it: <strong>YOU</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/b3a18b8d9d1f78ab75205727fc14c2d2.poster.avif?t=1743450237\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/b3a18b8d9d1f78ab75205727fc14c2d2.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/b3a18b8d9d1f78ab75205727fc14c2d2.mp4?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform the run-down shack into a dreamlike arcade hall:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by operating the arcade hall. Open the shop and take care of customers as they spend money on your machines. From exchanging coins to clearing the trash, there's a lot to do, including physically removing customers who misbehave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/09a8fab9045ebb1e24f0a0a07defd6dd.poster.avif?t=1743450237\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/09a8fab9045ebb1e24f0a0a07defd6dd.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st