tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/f1ee562892f4c8ec6ae80635182a0674.webm?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866530/extras/f1ee562892f4c8ec6ae80635182a0674.mp4?t=1743450237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
